{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02728","headline":"酬薛舍人万年宫晚景寓直怀友 · 上官仪","name":"酬薛舍人万年宫晚景寓直怀友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奕奕九成台，窈窕绝尘埃。\n苍苍万年树，玲珑下冥雾。\n池色摇晚空，岩花歛余煦。\n清切丹禁静，浩荡文河注。\n留连穷胜托，夙期暌善谑。\n东望安仁省，西临子云阁。\n长啸披烟霞，高步寻兰若。\n金狄掩通门，雕鞍归骑喧。\n燕姝对明月，荆艳促芳尊。\n别有青山路，策杖访王孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}